    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Sovereign is an adult fantasy RPG that plunges you into the saga of a world torn between forces of lust and purity. As you enter the complex conflict, you forge a new path that will change the course of history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...maybe. The thing is, acting like most heroes gets you killed, and most evil overlords' plans make no sense. The Last Sovereign is a game that twists your expectations for adult games, while fully embracing a reconstruction of some familiar old tropes to provide a lot of fun, sexy content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By telling a story that has sex as an integral component, The Last Sovereign offers a deep storyline that naturally includes adult content. Not only will you adventure in a world where sex is a weapon, you'll build a harem of fully-realized characters with their own reasons for being with you... in and out of the bedroom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No grinding or random battles: finite enemies visible on map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 250 sex scenes, over 200 fully illustrated,\u00a0including over 1200 images total. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the differing opinions and priorities of 20+ harem members.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in over 150 different assets that have an impact on the plot and provide financial returns as the story progresses (Chapter 1+). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiate deals between kingdoms and organizations, shaping the course of nations and religions (Chapter 2+).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and customize a home base (Chapter 4+).</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Sovereign is an adult fantasy RPG that plunges you into the saga of a world torn between forces of lust and purity. As you enter the complex conflict, you forge a new path that will change the course of history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...maybe. The thing is, acting like most heroes gets you killed, and most evil overlords' plans make no sense. The Last Sovereign is a game that twists your expectations for adult games, while fully embracing a reconstruction of some familiar old tropes to provide a lot of fun, sexy content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By telling a story that has sex as an integral component, The Last Sovereign offers a deep storyline that naturally includes adult content. Not only will you adventure in a world where sex is a weapon, you'll build a harem of fully-realized characters with their own reasons for being with you... in and out of the bedroom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No grinding or random battles: finite enemies visible on map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 250 sex scenes, over 200 fully illustrated,\u00a0including over 1200 images total. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the differing opinions and priorities of 20+ harem members.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in over 150 different assets that have an impact on the plot and provide financial returns as the story progresses (Chapter 1+). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiate deals between kingdoms and organizations, shaping the course of nations and religions (Chapter 2+).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and customize a home base (Chapter 4+).</p></li></ul>",
