    "reviews": "\u201cHonestly, this is one of my favorite adult games. Intelligently written, humorous, and characters with realistic motivations (for their world anyways). ... If you like plot instead of just &quot;plot&quot;, then The Last Sovereign is for you.\u201d<br>quiller<br><br>\u201cFrom the world building, to the dialog, to the characters, I\u2019ve really gotten into this game a lot. The sexuality is handled with what can only be described as a frightening amount of maturity. I love the fact that as important as sex is in this game and world, that the game doesn't FEEL pornographic. I love the fact that the characters have emotional bonds and reasons for being, even characters like Yarra and Qum. The quality of the writing, and the fact that the game is so much more than a vehicle for sex scenes, really make it a stand out piece. I can't quite gush enough how much I enjoy it, as a game, as porn, but also as overall fiction.\u201d<br>ksoma<br><br>\u201cHoly crap it is outrageously well written. The protagonists are all brilliant: their banter is pitch-perfect and effortlessly endearing. I'm used to finding characters in porn games attractive (that is, after all, the point), but I don't think I've ever grown to like them before. I'm seriously blown away by the characterization. Plus, the plot is actually interesting too! Oh yeah, and the sex is hot.\u201d<br>Acrolith<br>",
